  "limitations": [
    "Sequential string-literal-list loops with native checkout and condition children only; no dynamic collections, nested loops or loop-output continuity claim.",
    "Order and multiplicity are observed from native checkout arguments and distinct executed step identities; workspace markers alone do not prove either.",
    "Failure origin is a native missing-revision checkout and must stop later iterations and the successor. Empty input executes no body.",
    "The full unmodified generated Jenkinsfile runs in a disposable pinned Jenkins controller with network disabled and a local Git fixture.",
    "No general public support or portable-execution promotion. The runtime host remains trusted."
  ]
